<!-- ============ 01 POSITIONING ============ -->
<section class="sec intro">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="idx">01</span>
      <span class="label">Why Dateen</span>
      <span class="meta">Capability, at a glance</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <div class="rv">
        <p class="intro-state">One supplier for every meal your office will ever need, <span class="em">trusted, scheduled, invoiced.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-right rv rv-d1">
        <p>Dateen runs a single kitchen discipline across six service lines. The same standards that plate a full-scale buffet govern a one-box bento, so procurement signs once, and every order after that simply arrives.</p>
        <ul class="intro-points">
          <li>
            <span class="n">A</span>
            <div><b>Trusted by 20+ corporates</b><p>SC Johnson, Unilever, Samsung, PwC and more, on standing corporate accounts.</p></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="n">B</span>
            <div><b>Corporate credit terms</b><p>Standing orders, monthly invoicing, procurement-friendly documentation.</p></div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="n">C</span>
            <div><b>Klang Valley logistics</b><p>Scheduled daily supply with same-day delivery for orders confirmed before 10:00am.</p></div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

