<!-- ============ 06 STORY ============ -->
<section class="sec story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head rv">
      <span class="idx">06</span>
      <span class="label">The Company</span>
      <span class="meta">2007, present</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="display-lg sec-title rv">Nineteen years of <span class="em" style="color:var(--red);">refined service.</span></h2>
    <div class="sec-body">
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p class="rv">Dateen began in 2007 as <strong>Jom Makan Place</strong>, a neighbourhood kitchen operating on homemade recipes. Demand from nearby offices led to a structured corporate catering operation, eventually scaling to feed hundreds while maintaining consistency across every order.</p>
        <p class="rv">In <strong>2024</strong>, the business joined Gourmet Nation Sdn Bhd, formalising procurement relationships with larger corporate clients while preserving the recipes and standards that established the brand.</p>
        <div class="tl rv rv-d1">
          <div class="tl-row">
            <span class="yr">2007</span>
            <div><b>Jom Makan Place opens</b><p>A neighbourhood kitchen, homemade recipes.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-row">
            <span class="yr">2015</span>
            <div><b>Corporate catering begins</b><p>First office accounts. Bento line launched.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-row">
            <span class="yr">2024</span>
            <div><b>Joins Gourmet Nation</b><p>Rebranded as Dateen under Gourmet Nation Sdn Bhd.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-row">
            <span class="yr">2026</span>
            <div><b>20+ corporate accounts</b><p>Bungkus supply, buffet, bento &amp; festive lines at full operation.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="story-visual rv rv-d1">
        <div class="story-ph1"></div>
        <div class="story-ph2"></div>
        <div class="story-mark"><b>19</b><span>Years in service</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 07 PROCESS ============ -->
